3Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-11-11T08:56:00.064Z\"},\"displayedOnLanguages\":\"both\",\"title\":\"SECRET·STORY·FAIRY TALE - the golden ages of the Vigadó\",\"date\":\"Permanent\",\"cta\":{\"label\":\"More\",\"href\":\"https://vigado.hu/hu/programok/titoktortenetmese?idopont=281\"}}],\"blockType\":\"heroSliderBlock\"},{\"id\":\"6ac77e6d4b4fcc1fd0d92142\",\"sectionId\":null,\"isReversedMobile\":false,\"backgroundImage\":null,\"sectionBackgroundColor\":null,\"containerBackgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"divider\":false,\"blockName\":\"Vigadó célja és nyitvatartás\",\"blockType\":\"splitSectionBlock\",\"leftContent\":[{\"id\":\"6ac77e6d4b4fcc1fd0d92143\",\"blockName\":null,\"blockType\":\"textContentBlock\",\"content\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"tag\":\"h4\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Pesti Vigadó is committed to preserving cultural diversity and maintaining high artistic standards for its audiences.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"direction\":null}}}],\"rightContent\":[{\"id\":\"6ac77e6d4b4fcc1fd0d92144\",\"blockName\":null,\"blockType\":\"textContentBlock\",\"content\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Since opening in 1865, Pesti Vigadó has served as a central venue for social life in every era.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"It has hosted concerts by Strauss, Liszt, Erkel, Wagner, Bartók and Dohnányi, the first art exhibition in Hungary organised by the Pest Art Society and the first representative National Assembly, as well as a presentation of the Blériot XI aircraft and some of the most popular balls of each period.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}}}],\"columnSize\":{\"left\":5,\"right\":6}},{\"id\":\"6936c6c1b7c2ec78a11fa3ca\",\"blockName\":\"Kiemelt programok\",\"blockType\":\"highlightedProgramsBlock\",\"programs\":[{\"id\":8,\"title\":\"Historic walk tour at the birthplace of Budapest\",\"description\":\"Discover the 190-year-old history and architecture of the Pesti Vigadó!\",\"coverImage\":{\"id\":44,\"alt\":\"Epulettorteneti_seta_borito\",\"prefix\":\"media\",\"folder\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2025-11-11T12:51:45.161Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-11-11T12:51:45.160Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/Epulettorteneti_seta_borito.jpg\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"Epulettorteneti_seta_borito.jpg\",\"mimeType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"filesize\":244625,\"width\":1770,\"height\":800,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"slug\":\"mesel-a-vigado--epulettorteneti-seta\",\"slugLock\":true,\"alwaysActive\":false,\"isArchived\":null,\"category\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Épületséta\",\"displayName\":\"Historic Walk Tour\",\"showInListFilters\":true,\"showInCalendarFilters\":true,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-11T10:41:31.337Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-15T14:13:18.872Z\"},\"room\":{\"id\":24,\"name\":\"Pesti Vigadó\",\"floor\":\"0 - 6th \",\"coverImage\":44,\"rentConfig\":{\"isRentable\":null,\"capacity\":null,\"sidebarInfo\":null,\"rentUrl\":null,\"content\":[]},\"visitConfig\":{\"isVisitable\":null,\"rentUrl\":null,\"content\":[]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-08T14:17:44.892Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-06T09:22:38.883Z\"},\"lengthInfo\":null,\"content\":[{\"id\":\"691330d53a4744dcf1c7cf14\",\"blockName\":null,\"blockType\":\"textContentBlock\",\"content\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Discover the Pesti Vigadó, one of Budapest’s most impressive cultural landmarks, which is not only an architectural masterpiece but also a key venue in Hungarian history and the arts.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"The Pesti Vigadó warmly welcomes those interested in the building's beautiful interior, history, and panoramic views on scheduled dates. Visitors can explore the entire historic building accompanied by our professional guides, admire the impressive architectural features and hidden treasures, learn about the architects and artists who shaped this unique place, and discover how the building's role has evolved over the centuries.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Don't miss this unique opportunity to experience history up close within the magical walls of the Pesti Vigadó!\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"IMPORTANT INFORMATION:\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"The expected duration of the tour is 60 minutes.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"linebreak\",\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"We kindly ask our guests to comply with the house rules and accept the terms and conditions of our service.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"linebreak\",\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Please read our Visitor Information Guide.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"linebreak\",\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Visitors aged 70 and over can participate in the Architectural History Tours with a senior ticket.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"linebreak\",\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"During the tour, visitors can explore parts of the building that are not typically open to the public or are only partially accessible! The ticket price includes the guided tour as well as access to all exhibitions.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"linebreak\",\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"The maximum group size is 35 people, and reservations can be made with advance ticket purchase.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"For more information:\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Ticket Office: +36 (1) 328-3340\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Audience Management: \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"autolink\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"mailto:turizmus@vigado.hu\",\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":2,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"turizmus@vigado.hu\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Holders of the free Pesti Vigadó Club Card receive a 3% discount on the program price.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}}}],\"events\":[{\"id\":405,\"adminTitle\":\"Mesél a Vigadó – Épülettörténeti séta - 2026.11.28 10:30\",\"title\":\"Mesél a Vigadó – Épülettörténeti séta\",\"slug\":\"mesel-a-vigado--epulettorteneti-seta\",\"slugLock\":true,\"startDate\":\"2026-11-28T09:30:00.000Z\",\"endDate\":null,\"displayedOnLanguages\":\"hu\",\"interticketLink\":\"https://vigado.jegy.hu/program/mesel-a-vigado-epulettorteneti-seta-121329/1513897\",\"ticketPrice\":\"4 000 Ft\",\"registrationParams\":{\"registrationEnabled\":false,\"maxParticipants\":1,\"maxCounterPerUser\":null,\"openPositions\":null,\"acceptedRegistrations\":null,\"acceptedParticipants\":null,\"onWaitingList\":null,\"onWaitingListParticipants\":null,\"cancelledRegistrations\":null,\"cancelledParticipants\":null,\"pendingConfirmations\":null,\"pendingParticipants\":null},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T15:13:31.323Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T15:13:31.323Z\"},{\"id\":406,\"adminTitle\":\"Historic walk tour at the birthplace of Budapest - 2026.11.28 11:45\",\"title\":\"Historic walk tour at the birthplace of Budapest\",\"slug\":\"historic-walk-tour-at-the-birthplace-of-budapest\",\"slugLock\":true,\"startDate\":\"2026-11-28T10:45:00.0